public interface KSuspendFunction13<in P1, in P2, in P3, in P4, in P5, in P6, in P7, in P8, in P9, in P10, in P11, in P12, in P13, out R> : KFunction<R>, suspend (P1, P2, P3, P4, P5, P6, P7, P8, P9, P10, P11, P12, P13) -> R
public interface KSuspendFunction14<in P1, in P2, in P3, in P4, in P5, in P6, in P7, in P8, in P9, in P10, in P11, in P12, in P13, in P14, out R> : KFunction<R>, suspend (P1, P2, P3, P4, P5, P6, P7, P8, P9, P10, P11, P12, P13, P14) -> R
